# The JSON API is built and tested but intentionally not deployed yet.
# Excluding api/ stops Vercel turning those files into serverless functions.
# The directory stays in the repo — the MCP server bundles api/_lib/* at build
# time, and `pnpm typecheck` still covers it.
#
# To switch the API on: delete the api/ line below, restore the API typecheck
# in the `build` script, and re-enable the endpoints in public/llms.txt.
# See "Enabling the JSON API" in README.md.
api/

design-reference/
